/*
 * ============================================================
 * IoT Health Monitoring System v2.0 — ESP32
 * ============================================================
 * Sensors:
 *   HW-827 (Heartbeat)   -> GPIO34 (ADC / Digital interrupt)
 *   DS18B20 (Temperature)-> GPIO4  (OneWire)
 *   MPU6050 (Accel/Gyro) -> GPIO21 (SDA), GPIO22 (SCL)
 *
 * Improvements over v1:
 *   - Multi-stage fall detection: free-fall → impact → inactivity
 *   - Orientation-based post-fall confirmation
 *   - More forgiving temperature thresholds (35.0 – 39.5 °C)
 *   - Live scrolling charts for BPM & Temperature (pure canvas)
 *   - Animated heart SVG and temperature gauge
 *   - Separate /api/history endpoint for graph data
 *   - Dark-mode medical dashboard UI
 *   - WiFi auto-reconnect
 *   - Uptime and alert-count stats
 * ============================================================
 */

